    <title>ros2官方安装</title>
    <link href="/2025/08/23/ros2%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85/"/>
    <url>/2025/08/23/ros2%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="ros2-官方安装-（非小鱼）"><a href="#ros2-官方安装-（非小鱼）" class="headerlink" title="ros2 官方安装 （非小鱼）"></a>ros2 官方安装 （非小鱼）</h1><h2 id="简介"><a href="#简介" class="headerlink" title="简介"></a>简介</h2><p>对于ros2的系统安装，一般使用fishros安装。（ps：因为方便快捷）但是，根据群友的使用来说，小鱼安装极其流氓，可能以后会遇上玄学bug和环境问题，发现是小鱼问题（不过目前没有出现）。</p><p>这只是做一个尝试存档（毕竟如果只会用小鱼，有点逆天），环境：wsl2 ubuntu22.04.5</p><h2 id="步骤"><a href="#步骤" class="headerlink" title="步骤"></a>步骤</h2><hr><h2 id="1-更换系统软件源（清华镜像）"><a href="#1-更换系统软件源（清华镜像）" class="headerlink" title="1. 更换系统软件源（清华镜像）"></a>1. 更换系统软件源（清华镜像）</h2><p>为加快 ROS 相关依赖的下载速度，推荐先更换系统的 apt 源。</p><p>然后替换为清华的源（Jammy 版本）：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 1. 备份原有源列表</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">cp</span> /etc/apt/sources.list /etc/apt/sources.list.bak<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 2. 写入清华源配置 (适用于 x86_64/amd64 架构)</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">tee</span> /etc/apt/sources.list &gt; /dev/null &lt;&lt;<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;EOF&#x27;</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 默认注释了源码镜像以提高 apt update 速度，如有需要可自行取消注释</span><br>deb https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/ubuntu/ jammy main restricted universe multiverse<br><span class="hljs-comment"># deb-src https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/ubuntu/ jammy main restricted universe multiverse</span><br>deb https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/ubuntu/ jammy-updates main restricted universe multiverse<br><span class="hljs-comment"># deb-src https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/ubuntu/ jammy-updates main restricted universe multiverse</span><br>deb https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/ubuntu/ jammy-backports main restricted universe multiverse<br><span class="hljs-comment"># deb-src https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/ubuntu/ jammy-backports main restricted universe multiverse</span><br>deb https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/ubuntu/ jammy-security main restricted universe multiverse<br><span class="hljs-comment"># deb-src https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/ubuntu/ jammy-security main restricted universe multiverse</span><br>EOF<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 3. 更新软件列表</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt update<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 4. 可选：升级所有已安装的包</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt upgrade -y<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="2-设置语言环境（locale）"><a href="#2-设置语言环境（locale）" class="headerlink" title="2. 设置语言环境（locale）"></a>2. 设置语言环境（locale）</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt install locales<br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> locale-gen en_US en_US.UTF-8<br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> update-locale LC_ALL=en_US.UTF-8 LANG=en_US.UTF-8<br><span class="hljs-built_in">export</span> LANG=en_US.UTF-8<br>locale  <span class="hljs-comment"># 验证</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="3-添加-ROS-2-的-APT-软件源"><a href="#3-添加-ROS-2-的-APT-软件源" class="headerlink" title="3. 添加 ROS 2 的 APT 软件源"></a>3. 添加 ROS 2 的 APT 软件源</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt install software-properties-common<br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> add-apt-repository universe<br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt update<br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt install curl -y<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>添加 GPG 密钥：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> curl -sSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ros/rosdistro/master/ros.key -o /usr/share/keyrings/ros-archive-keyring.gpg<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>添加 ROS 软件源：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;deb [arch=<span class="hljs-subst">$(dpkg --print-architecture)</span> signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/ros-archive-keyring.gpg] \</span><br><span class="hljs-string">http://packages.ros.org/ros2/ubuntu <span class="hljs-subst">$(. /etc/os-release &amp;&amp; echo $UBUNTU_CODENAME)</span> main&quot;</span> | \<br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">tee</span> /etc/apt/sources.list.d/ros2.list &gt; /dev/null<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="4-更新系统并安装-ROS-2"><a href="#4-更新系统并安装-ROS-2" class="headerlink" title="4.更新系统并安装 ROS 2"></a>4.更新系统并安装 ROS 2</h3><p>ROS 2 软件包建立在经常更新的 Ubuntu 系统上。 始终建议您在安装新软件包之前确保您的系统是最新的。</p><p>更新系统（⚠️ 非常关键，避免依赖错误）：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt update<br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt upgrade<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>桌面安装（推荐）：ROS、RViz、演示、教程。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt install ros-humble-desktop<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>ROS-Base Install（Bare Bones）：通信库、消息包、命令行工具。 没有 GUI 工具。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt install ros-humble-ros-base<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>开发工具：用于构建 ROS 包的编译器和其他工具</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt install ros-dev-tools<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="5-设置-ROS-环境变量（自动加载）"><a href="#5-设置-ROS-环境变量（自动加载）" class="headerlink" title="5. 设置 ROS 环境变量（自动加载）"></a>5. 设置 ROS 环境变量（自动加载）</h3><p>每次打开终端都需要手动执行 <code>source</code> 太麻烦，可以添加到 <code>bashrc</code> 或 <code>zshrc</code>：</p><p>对于 bash 用户：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash&quot;</span> &gt;&gt; ~/.bashrc<br><span class="hljs-built_in">source</span> ~/.bashrc<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>对于 zsh 用户：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;source /opt/ros/humble/setup.zsh&quot;</span> &gt;&gt; ~/.zshrc<br><span class="hljs-built_in">source</span> ~/.zshrc<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="6-rosdep使用"><a href="#6-rosdep使用" class="headerlink" title="6.rosdep使用"></a>6.rosdep使用</h2><h4 id="1-初始化rosdep（首次使用前必须执行）"><a href="#1-初始化rosdep（首次使用前必须执行）" class="headerlink" title="1. 初始化rosdep（首次使用前必须执行）"></a>1. 初始化rosdep（首次使用前必须执行）</h4><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> rosdep init  <span class="hljs-comment"># 初始化系统配置</span><br>rosdep update     <span class="hljs-comment"># 更新本地依赖数据库</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="2-安装工作空间的依赖"><a href="#2-安装工作空间的依赖" class="headerlink" title="2. 安装工作空间的依赖"></a>2. 安装工作空间的依赖</h4><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 在ROS 2工作空间目录下执行</span><br>rosdep install --from-paths src --ignore-src -y --rosdistro <span class="hljs-variable">$ROS_DISTRO</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li><p><code>--from-paths src</code>：从src目录查找所有包</p></li><li><p><code>--ignore-src</code>：跳过已存在的源码包</p></li><li><p><code>-y</code>：自动确认安装</p></li><li><p><code>--rosdistro</code>：指定ROS发行版（如humble、iron）</p></li></ul>]]></content>
    
    
    
